---
import { Heart, Sparkles, MessageCircle, CheckCircle2, ArrowRight } from 'lucide-astro';

const communityWhatsAppUrl = "https://wa.me/34613491695?text=" + encodeURIComponent("Hola Shirley, me gustaría unirme a la comunidad de SaludConCiencia y recibir información sobre LMC.");
---

<section class="py-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50 relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-brand-dark text-white p-8 sm:p-14 border border-neutral-800 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
      
      <!-- Glowing Background Highlights -->
      <div class="absolute -top-32 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-lime/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-32 -left-32 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-blue/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center space-y-8 relative z-10">
        
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-lime text-brand-dark text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider">
          <Heart class="w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-brand-dark" />
          <span>Comunidad & Esperanza</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight">
          "Bienvenid@. No estás sol@ en este camino."
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed font-serif">
          Ojalá que, cuando termines de recorrer esta biblioteca, tengas muchas menos dudas que cuando llegaste. Y, sobre todo, que descubras que detrás de un diagnóstico hay una vida inmensa llena de proyectos y esperanza.
        </p>

        <!-- Direct WhatsApp Community Action (No forms needed) -->
        <div class="pt-4 max-w-xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
          <a 
            href={communityWhatsAppUrl}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-extrabold text-sm transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-glow-blue flex items-center justify-center gap-3 group"
          >
            <MessageCircle class="w-5 h-5 fill-white" />
            <span>Unirme a la Comunidad por WhatsApp (+34 613491695)</span>
          </a>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-xs text-neutral-400">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><CheckCircle2 class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-lime" /> Contacto directo</span>
            <span>·</span>
            <span>Acceso a nuevas guías y novedades</span>
            <span>·</span>
            <span>100% gratuito</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
